    {
      "subId": "7503304",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Xueyoni",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750330401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750330401": {
            "id": "750330401",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Xueyoni",
            "text": "You flew well, young one!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750330402"
            ]
          },
          "750330402": {
            "id": "750330402",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Acomitl",
            "text": "How was my flying just now?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750330405"
            ]
          },
          "750330405": {
            "id": "750330405",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Acomitl",
            "text": "Thanks for your encouragement, but I can tell you're still a cut above.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750330406"
            ]
          },
          "750330406": {
            "id": "750330406",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Matahga",
            "text": "Acomitl...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750330407"
            ]
          },
          "750330407": {
            "id": "750330407",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Acomitl",
            "text": "It's not what you think. I'm not discouraged because I can't outdo others. I can fly, I know I can.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750330408"
            ]
          },
          "750330408": {
            "id": "750330408",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Acomitl",
            "text": "Still, being in bad form for so long has ruined my self-confidence. I just can't approach flying with any sense of calm.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750330409"
            ]
          },
          "750330409": {
            "id": "750330409",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Acomitl",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}'s different. {M#His}{F#Her} posture is way more relaxed. Anyone with eyes can see that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750330410"
            ]
          },
          "750330410": {
            "id": "750330410",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Acomitl",
            "text": "Father, I know that you and sis want me to make up my own mind and not avoid the issue.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750330411"
            ]
          },
          "750330411": {
            "id": "750330411",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Acomitl",
            "text": "But if I told you now, that whether it's my body, my brain, or my heart...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750330412"
            ]
          },
          "750330412": {
            "id": "750330412",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Acomitl",
            "text": "That they all refuse to continue on a path that's not meant for me... Would you still support me?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750330413"
            ]
          },
          "750330413": {
            "id": "750330413",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Manyoya",
            "text": "It's okay, so long as it's your own decision, and you're willing to shoulder the consequences.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750330414"
            ]
          },
          "750330414": {
            "id": "750330414",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Acomitl",
            "text": "Matahga, will you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750330415"
            ]
          },
          "750330415": {
            "id": "750330415",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Matahga",
            "text": "Hey! I'm not going to criticize you at a time like this. I've always known the sort of person you are, Big Brother.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750330416"
            ]
          },
          "750330416": {
            "id": "750330416",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Matahga",
            "text": "If you can't handle this, then just make a decisive break with it. As long as you stay true to yourself, you remain a warrior. No one has the right to criticize you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750330417"
            ]
          },
          "750330417": {
            "id": "750330417",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Xueyoni",
            "text": "Sometimes, the job of a Master Trainer is quite easy. I make training plans for warriors, but I don't have to take part myself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750330418"
            ]
          },
          "750330418": {
            "id": "750330418",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Xueyoni",
            "text": "However, I, too, once flew around with Saurians day in and day out, and I know the true face of that kind of life.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750330419"
            ]
          },
          "750330419": {
            "id": "750330419",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Xueyoni",
            "text": "Criticizing others is easy. Taking action is always harder.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750330420"
            ]
          },
          "750330420": {
            "id": "750330420",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Xueyoni",
            "text": "As a trainer, I suggest you request time off to recuperate both physically and mentally, even if it leads to dissatisfaction within the team.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750330421"
            ]
          },
          "750330421": {
            "id": "750330421",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Xueyoni",
            "text": "As your father, I know you don't want to continue, and I respect that choice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750330422"
            ]
          },
          "750330422": {
            "id": "750330422",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Xueyoni",
            "text": "No longer being part of the flying squad isn't the end of the world. The warriors of the Flower-Feather Clan don't have to prove their worth through flying alone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750330423"
            ]
          },
          "750330423": {
            "id": "750330423",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Acomitl",
            "text": "Thank you... I was worried you'd...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750330424"
            ]
          },
          "750330424": {
            "id": "750330424",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Manyoya",
            "text": "Don't overthink it. We're your family, and we'll always help you find a way, no matter what.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750330425"
            ]
          },
          "750330425": {
            "id": "750330425",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Being a warrior sure is tough! Paimon never imagined it would be this hard to join the Flower-Feather Clan's flying squad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7503309",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Xueyoni",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
